            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena, watatu miongoni mwa wale thelathini waliokuwa wakuu wakashuka, wakamwendea Daudi wakati wa mavuno mpaka pango la Adulamu, na kikosi cha Wafilisti walikuwa wamefanya kambi katika bonde la Warefai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.22.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 22:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.12.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Nya 12:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi wakati ule alikuwako ngomeni, na jeshi la Wafilisti wakati ule walikuwako Bethlehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akatamani, akasema, Laiti mtu angeninywesha maji ya kisima cha Bethlehemu, kilicho karibu na lango! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi hao mashujaa watatu wakapenya jeshi la Wafilisti, wakateka maji kutoka kile kisima cha Bethlehemu, kilicho karibu na lango, wakayachukua, wakamletea Daudi; walakini yeye hakukubali kuyanywa, akayamimina mbele za BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.17.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 17:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasema, Hasha, BWANA, nisifanye hivi; je! Si damu hii ya watu hao waliohatirisha nafsi zao? Kwa hiyo hakukubali kuyanywa. Hayo ndiyo waliyoyafanya wale mashujaa watatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
