        },
        {
          "text": "huyo naye akamwua Mmisri, mtu mrefu; naye huyo Mmisri alikuwa na mkuki mkononi; lakini yeye alimshukia na gongo, akamnyakulia Mmisri mkuki mkononi mwake, akamwua kwa mkuki wake mwenyewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
